# lzrprf approval keys: the keys whose signature approves a LZRBRWSR release, besides the release key's.
# One OpenSSH public key per line. The first is made in the Secure Enclave of the owner's phone by the core app,
# opens only to his Face ID and never leaves the phone. A release is installed only when one of these keys and the
# release key (release-key.pub) both signed its manifest. Until a key is written here, no release is signed.
